    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Duffy offer to market 36 Riverview, St Nicholas Gardens, Dundalk, by way of Online Auction on Thursday the 8th of October 2026 at 10am.\n\nAuction/Bidding Link - https://duffy.dngauctions.ie/lot/details/0cce800a-8b34-4484-94a9-7bd5b2ee5ad7\n\nA well-proportioned two-bedroom apartment extending to approximately 63 sq. m., situated within a secure and established development just a short distance from Dundalk town centre.\n\nPositioned within a gated complex with designated parking and controlled access, this property offers both security and convenience. The accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a bright open-plan kitchen/living area, two well-sized bedrooms, and a family bathroom. The layout is practical and efficiently designed, making it suitable for owner-occupiers and investors alike.\n\nRiverview enjoys a highly accessible location within walking distance of Dundalk town centre and its full range of retail, dining, and transport amenities. The development's proximity to Bridge Street ensures ease of access while maintaining a private residential setting.\n\nTo enhance the purchasing process, virtual viewing is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, allowing interested parties to explore the property at their convenience. DNG Duffy also provide secure online bidding to ensure a transparent and streamlined sales experience.\n\n2026 Service Charge: 1,340 \n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the convenience, secure setting, and strong potential of this two-bedroom apartment.\n\nNote:\nProspective buyers are strongly recommended to confirm the floor areas as part of their thorough investigation. The provided pictures, maps, and dimensions are purely for illustrative purposes, and it is crucial for potential buyers to independently verify the final finishes and measurements of the property and its surrounding land. It is important to note that no testing has been conducted on any appliances, fixtures, fittings, or services. All measurements are approximate, and the photographs are intended to provide guidance rather than absolute accuracy. The property is sold in its current condition, and any potential buyer should ensure their own satisfaction with the property before making a bid."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.0m x 3.7m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.0m x 1.6m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.0m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.8m x 4.1m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.7m x 6.9m\n\n\n"
